  <section class="chapter" id="process"><div class="shell chapter-heading reveal"><p class="label">Application process</p><h2><span>Application</span><em>process</em></h2></div><div class="shell timeline"><article class="timeline__item reveal"><span class="timeline__index">01</span><div class="timeline__body"><h3>Submit your application</h3><p>Complete the application form and upload the required documents.</p></div></article><article class="timeline__item reveal"><span class="timeline__index">02</span><div class="timeline__body"><h3>Review and interview</h3><p>Your application is reviewed by the admissions team. You may be invited to an online interview.</p></div></article><article class="timeline__item reveal"><span class="timeline__index">03</span><div class="timeline__body"><h3>Admission decision</h3><p>You will receive a decision and, if successful, an offer with the next steps to confirm your place.</p></div></article><article class="timeline__item reveal"><span class="timeline__index">04</span><div class="timeline__body"><h3>Visa and arrival</h3><p>Students requiring a visa complete the process through their local Swiss embassy or consulate. Helvetic Tech provides guidance and supporting documentation.</p></div></article></div></section>
