  <h2 class="editorial__title reveal">Introduction</h2>
  <div class="editorial__cols reveal"><p>Campus life at Helvetic Tech is shaped by a combination of focused academic study, an international environment, and a unique location on the shores of Lake Geneva.</p><p>The experience extends beyond the classroom, offering students the opportunity to study in a setting that supports both personal development and exposure to a global environment.</p></div>
