</section><section class="story chapter" id="story">
  <div class="shell chapter-heading reveal"><p class="label">Career outcomes</p><h2><span>Your career</span><em>starts here</em></h2></div>
  <div class="shell story-layout">
    <aside class="story-index" aria-hidden="true"><span class="story-index__now" data-story-now>01</span><span class="story-index__total">/ 05</span><span class="story-index__track"><i data-story-bar></i></span></aside>
    <div class="story-chapters" data-story>
      <article class="story-chapter reveal" data-story-chapter="01">
        <p class="story-chapter__label"><span>01</span>The Helvetic Tech career advantage</p>
        <h3>The Helvetic Tech career advantage</h3>
        <p>The career advantage at Helvetic Tech is built on a combination of academic structure, environment, and exposure. Students benefit from a dual-degree model, a personalized learning experience with close faculty interaction, a location within a dynamic economic region, and an international student community.</p>
      </article><article class="story-chapter reveal" data-story-chapter="02">
        <p class="story-chapter__label"><span>02</span>Dual-degree career value</p>
        <h3>Dual-degree career value</h3>
        <p>One of the defining features of the Helvetic Tech experience is its dual-degree structure. Students graduate with a Swiss qualification alongside a degree from Tiffin University, combining two complementary academic systems.</p>
      </article><article class="story-chapter reveal" data-story-chapter="03">
        <p class="story-chapter__label"><span>03</span>Career pathways</p>
        <h3>Career pathways</h3>
        <p>Graduates of Helvetic Tech pursue opportunities across a variety of sectors, including technology, consulting, finance, and digital industries. Rather than focusing on a single predefined path, the programs emphasize versatility.</p>
      </article><article class="story-chapter reveal" data-story-chapter="04">
        <p class="story-chapter__label"><span>04</span>Skills for the modern workplace</p>
        <h3>Skills for the modern workplace</h3>
        <p>Throughout their studies, students develop a combination of technical and transferable skills that are essential in today’s job market. These include analytical thinking and problem-solving, digital and technological competencies, communication and teamwork, and cross-cultural awareness.</p>
      </article><article class="story-chapter reveal" data-story-chapter="05">
        <p class="story-chapter__label"><span>05</span>Your career starts here</p>
        <h3>Your career starts here</h3>
        <p>Career development at Helvetic Tech begins from the first day of the program. Through a combination of academic learning, practical exposure, and an international perspective, students build a foundation that supports long-term growth.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section><section class="next-band" data-chapter="Programs"><a class="shell next-band__link reveal" href="{{home_url}}/programs/"><span class="label">Programs</span><strong>Dual Bachelor &amp; Master Degrees</strong><i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></a></section>',
